UnitVotingEscrow::GetPastVotes
├── when the timestamp is after the current block
│   └── it should revert with FutureLookup
├── when the timestamp equals the current block
│   └── it should return the votes at the current block
├── when the timestamp is before the first checkpoint
│   └── it should return zero
├── when the timestamp falls between checkpoints
│   └── it should return the earlier checkpoint delegated balance
└── when the account is not the checkpoint owner
    └── it should return zero
